<title>TUNISIA: Tunisia buys 33,000 T soy oil -trade.</title>
<headline>Tunisia buys 33,000 T soy oil -trade.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisia bought 33,000 tonnes of soy oil at $542 to $549 C&amp;F per tonne at a tender on Thursday, traders said.</p>
<p>Delivery is for 5-20 December 1996 and 5-20 January 1997, they added.  </p>
<p>No other details were available.</p>
<p>The tender was launched on Wednesday for up to 12,000 tonnes of soy and/or rapeseed oil by the state-buying body Office National de l'Huile.</p>
